      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The policy you provided only grants permission to put objects into the bucket, but you might be missing the ability to list or interact with prefixes depending on how your lambda requests logging. Ensure your IAM role also has permissions for the specific resource ARN, not just the bucket root. Double-check the execution role attached to your Lambda function, as that is what AWS enforces the permissions against.",
